        "num": 1,
        "text": "Official English Q&A for BT16-014 (Mar. 28, 2024)"
      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it activates.  This card's \"this Digimon gains all effects of [Goldramon] in this Digimon's digivolution cards\"  effect is an [All Turns] effect, so it will activate as soon as the digivolution is confirmed. Therefore, [When Evolving] effects are gained and will trigger.",
        "question": "This card digivolved from [BT14-018 Goldramon]. This Digimon gains all effects of [Goldramon] in digivolution cards, but does [BT14-018 Goldramon]'s [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.  If this card's [All Turns] effect is used to gain a [When Digivolving] effect, this card's [When Digivolving] effect and the [When Digivolving] effect gained from the [All Turns] effect will trigger simultaneously upon the digivolution timing, therefore you may choose the activation order.",
        "question": "This card digivolved from [EX3-035 Goldramon]. This Digimon gains all effects of [Goldramon] in digivolution cards, but after [EX3-035 Goldramon]'s [When Digivolving] effect activates and I return [EX3-069 Trial of the Four Great Dragons] from the trash to the hand, can I use this card's [When Digivolving] effect to use [EX3-069 Trial of the Four Great Dragons] from my hand?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
